{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>We will cross over armed</b> The verse begins and ends with nun — meaning: we will cross the Jordan, which is fifty cubits wide. And it has twelve middle letters (תיכות) to hint (לו') that all twelve tribes will cross over." "<b>נחנו</b> Three times in the Masorah: נחנו נעבור · בני איש אחד נחנו · נחנו פשענו ומרינו. נחנו נעבור — why? For we are all sons of one man — נחנו. And if not — נחנו פשענו, as written: ודעו חטאתכם אשר תמצא אתכם."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:23:36.818601356Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}